<title>FRANCE: Saudi Arabia seeks 500,000 tonnes optional barley.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia seeks 500,000 tonnes optional barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia is in the market to import 500,000 tonnes of optional barley for February delivery onwards, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said Saudi Arabia had not yet officially announced a date for the tender.  </p>
<p>European exporters said the European Union currently had a supply advantage over the U.S. and Canada, where barley supplies are tight.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
